        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>INOX FH31PD8010, Regal Passage Pocket Door Hardware</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Regal Pocket Door Passage Set by INOX has a classic design that would look great in historic homes and new builds that want a glamorous feel. The Regal Pocket Door Trim comes packaged as a set including 2 arched flush pulls as well as a mortise box that has a finger edge pull. The Regal Passage Pocket Door Hardware is available in a wide selection of finish colors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Passage Function:</b> This set neither locks nor latches. It features two flush pulls and a mortise box with a built in finger edge pull to help retrieve the door from the pocket.\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/regal-pocket-door-privacy-set-inox-fh31pd8440\"><b>Privacy Set</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/regal-pocket-door-keyed-entry-inox-fh31pd8450\"><b>Keyed Entry Function</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Regal Sliding Door Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass or Stainless</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Height: 7-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Width: 2-23/64\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Projection: 5/64\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Height: 5-29/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Width: 11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Depth: 3-41/64\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Backset: 2-3/4\", 2-1/2\", or 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Finger Pull: is thrown by pressing the button on the mortise's face plate. It can be retracted simply by pressing it flush with the faceplate.</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/INX-FH31PD8010-specifications.pdf?v=1704262378\"><b>INOX FH31PD8010 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> two (2) flush pulls, a passage set mortise pull, and all mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
